### ==============================================================================
### PWA Store API - Phase 6: Developer Portal & Dashboard
### Base URL: http://localhost:8000/api/v1/developer
### All routes require Bearer Token (Sanctum) with 'developer' role / permissions
### Write operations are rate-limited via throttle:write (30 req/min per developer)
### ==============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000/api/v1/developer
@contentType = application/json
@acceptJson = application/json
@acceptLanguage = ar
@authToken = <TOKEN>

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. GET /developer/dashboard - لوحة معلومات وإحصائيات المطور (200 OK)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard
Accept: {{acceptJson}}
Accept-Language: {{acceptLanguage}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Response: 200 OK
