### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. GET /developer/pwas?status=rejected - تصفية التطبيقات المرفوضة مع سبب الرفض
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/pwas?status=rejected
Accept: {{acceptJson}}
Accept-Language: {{acceptLanguage}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

