### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 8. PUT /developer/pwas/{id} - تعديل تطبيق بحالة rejected أو draft (200 OK)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
PUT {{baseUrl}}/pwas/18
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Accept: {{acceptJson}}
Accept-Language: {{acceptLanguage}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "name": "تطبيق الدليل الطبي المحدث",
  "icon_url": "https://medical.example.com/new-icon-512.png"
}

### Response: 200 OK
